  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>塵與礦：原礦擴充</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6NJZSxXFPV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-JOIN-3f0f0f?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbobotweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-SUPPORT-3f0f0f?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fs%252f1qZlPl6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fiverr-HIRE ME-3f0f0f?style=for-the-badge&logo=fiverr&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Fiverr\"></a></p>\n<p>擴展您的礦物處理流程，納入 Minecraft 中最珍貴的材質！<br>此為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dust-and-ore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>塵與礦</strong></a> 的擴充套件，為鑽石與下界合金新增原礦與粉塵形態，完善您的工業處理鏈。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>更新內容</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>珍貴原礦材料</strong><br>- <strong>鑽石原礦</strong> - 從<strong>鑽石礦石</strong>中獲得，取代原本的成品<strong>鑽石</strong><br>- <strong>下界合金碎片原礦</strong> - 挖掘<strong>古代遺骸</strong>即可獲得<strong>下界合金碎片原礦</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>新增處理選項</strong></h2>\n<p>- <strong>熔鍊原礦：</strong><strong>鑽石原礦</strong> &rarr; <strong>鑽石</strong> | <strong>下界合金碎片原礦</strong> &rarr; <strong>下界合金碎片</strong><br>- <strong>粉碎成粉：</strong>使用來自<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dust-and-ore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">塵與礦</a></strong>模組的<strong>粉碎錘</strong>處理原礦材料<br>- <strong>熔鍊粉塵：</strong><strong>鑽石粉塵</strong> &rarr; <strong>鑽石</strong> | <strong>下界合金碎片粉塵</strong> &rarr; <strong>下界合金碎片</strong></p>",
